      "content": "The board is going to ask for specifics. They're worried about the fatigue reports coming in from the West Coast routes. Can you break down exactly how these specific shift patterns account for mandatory rest intervals and how they prevent driver burnout? Give me some technical/regulatory specifics I can use to shut down the union's argument.",
